<title>JAPAN: Cosmo Oil jumps on oil find in Timor Sea.</title>
<headline>Cosmo Oil jumps on oil find in Timor Sea.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cosmo Oil Co Ltd shares jumped in early Tuesday morning trade inspired by news that the firm's joint venture had discovered oil in the Timor Sea, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0032 GMT, the shares were up 17 yen at 489.  </p>
<p>Cultus Petroleum NL, the joint venture operator, said on Monday that the Tenacious-1 sidetrack test well flowed at 7,667 barrels of oil and 4.02 million cubic feet of gas per day.</p>
</text>
